      "text": "I’m using the career-profiler skill. Your preference is saved as alert only: no applications will ever be submitted. The other options are off (no watching), draft (drafts for review), and prepare (drafts plus screening answers); none submits, logs in, solves CAPTCHAs, or sends your data to job boards.\n\nYour profile will live at `/tmp/cp-astra-JiUroy/store`. We’re starting at 0/100 coverage. I’ll interview you a topic at a time, show the exact facts for confirmation, then save them. You can stop whenever you like.\n\nWhat name and email should appear on your resume? Do you have an existing resume or LinkedIn export to start from, or would you prefer to build everything through this interview?\n",
